        "id": 1318371
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-11-13T02:20:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is because the procedure of starting / suspending may take long time over seconds which depends on how quick the BT accessory can reply. If we return results directly, the caller will be stuck for long time by replied late so it is better to be asynchronous and wait for results or drop the call by caller (timed out).",
