      },
      "lineNbr": 61,
      "author": {
        "id": 1071489
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-11-14T18:09:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In case the same provider implements the handling for multiple session types - \nthe startSession(SessionType) will avoid the ambiguity which session type will be started.",
      "parentUuid": "16d3a41e_d3dd5644",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 60,
        "startChar": 45,
